  "insights": [
   "Week of Oct 12-16, 2026: September CPI and PPI ran hot, but the 10Y yield fell to a three-week low near 5.09% because the bond market priced an AI financing problem over inflation. Goldman's Privorotsky: 'the pain trade was long AI/short bonds. Now we're watching both sides unwind.'",
